# branch_else_goto -- branch on a computed parity with an else and a goto join, converging the arms to a single asserted `outcome`
# via the standard.test harness (README s13/s35). Prints PASS/FAIL + a summary;
# exit 0 iff the assertion holds.
# Expected output:
#   PASS  branch_else_goto  (expected 222, actual 222)
#   ---- 1 passed, 0 failed ----

BranchElseGoto is project
BranchElseGoto module examplesBranchElseGoto
BranchElseGoto target console
BranchElseGoto entry main

examplesBranchElseGoto is module
examplesBranchElseGoto path examples.branchElseGoto
examplesBranchElseGoto exports main
examplesBranchElseGoto purpose "branch on a computed parity with an else and a goto join"
examplesBranchElseGoto invariant "Self-checking via the test harness"

ExitCode is alias
ExitCode for Int32
ExitCode purpose "Process exit status"

stdoutWriter is capability
stdoutWriter grants write console.stdout
stdoutWriter purpose "Allow controlled writes to standard output"

main is operation
main out ExitCode
main effect write console.stdout
main uses stdoutWriter
main memory heap no
main async no
main purpose "branch on a computed parity with an else and a goto join and assert the outcome"
main invariant "Asserts the converged outcome via the harness"
main let harnessName immutable String "branch_else_goto"
main let harnessExpected immutable Int64 222
main let outcome mutable Int64 333
main let evenMark immutable Int64 222
main let inputValue immutable Int64 10
main let noopDecoy immutable Int64 0
main let noopName immutable String "branch_else_goto: real result (not the no-op 0)"
main do parity
main branch ifFalse isEven goto afterCheck
main set outcome evenMark
main at afterCheck do checkResult
main do noopCheck
main do harnessReport
main return harnessSummaryCode

parity is call
parity in main
parity invokes math.isEvenInt64
parity arg value Int64 inputValue
parity out isEven Bool

checkResult is call
checkResult in main
checkResult invokes test.assertEqualInt64
checkResult arg name String harnessName
checkResult arg expected Int64 harnessExpected
checkResult arg actual Int64 outcome

noopCheck is call
noopCheck in main
noopCheck invokes test.assertNotEqualInt64
noopCheck arg name String noopName
noopCheck arg expected Int64 noopDecoy
noopCheck arg actual Int64 outcome

harnessReport is call
harnessReport in main
harnessReport invokes test.summary
harnessReport out harnessSummaryCode ExitCode
